<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>NOTICE OF TEMPORARY SHUT DOWN OF PAYMENT PORTAL</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">On <strong>Tuesday, March 25, 2025 from 4:00 p.m. until 8:00 p.m.</strong> the City of Columbus will not be accepting payments through its Citizen Access Portal. During this time, we will be updating and testing the City's method for accepting payments online. When the update is complete, customer payments will be accepted via the City's new payment processing partner, Paymentus (Paymentus.com). The payment portal's appearance will change, but its functionality will remain the same.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for your patience and understanding during this period.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">###</p>
